{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HomeStray </strong>is a heartfelt adventure-exploration game where you guide <strong>Omie</strong>, a lost puppy, across mysterious islands in search of his beloved <strong>Sophia</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/003.png?t=1744342178\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop from island to island, solve puzzles, interact with charming creatures and NPCs. Discover new buddies along the way, each with <strong>special abilities</strong> that unlock new ways to navigate and interact with the world around you.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/001.jpg?t=1744342178\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a touching story about the many meanings of &quot;<strong>home</strong>&quot; as you shape Omie's journey through your choices, which affect his mental growth and ultimately determine one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/004.png?t=1744342178\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HomeStray combines charming exploration with meaningful decisions in a world filled with both comedy and hidden depths, where every distraction reshapes what &quot;<strong>home</strong>&quot; truly means. <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather clues to find your way home.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make friends with other animals.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't be caught by human as a stray dog!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore multiple unique islands with diverse cultures and animals.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different endings based on your decisions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/wish_list.png?t=1744342178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/line.png?t=1744342178\" />\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Wishlist now</strong> to be the first to know when we launch!  <br>Your support means everything to us, and wishlisting helps more people discover this heartfelt story. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/extras/line.png?t=1744342178\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Follow us for sneak peeks, dev updates, and behind-the-scenes content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc26 X (Twitter)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd8 Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf8 Instagram\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Join our Discord\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let\u2019s bring <strong>HomeStray</strong> to life together. See you on the journey home. \u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\udc36</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616730?t=1744342178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/6cf023d0a41117f955d831d641397b20cb5dce6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744342178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/dcb8450d58140bd183d67421b7e46f34d12f47dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744342178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616730/dcb8450d58140bd183d67421b7e46f34d12f47dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744342178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full con